  {"id": "save", "title": "Save a note",
   "sum": "The page sends the note; the server checks it, stores it and answers with its new id.",
   "steps": [
    {"go": [{"path": ["page", "api"], "kind": "req"}], "t": "The page sends the note as a POST request.", "c": "post", "hl": [12, 13]},
    {"go": [{"path": ["api", "check"], "kind": "req"}], "work": ["api"], "t": "The server hands the note to the validator.", "c": "handler", "hl": [21, 21]},
    {"go": [{"path": ["api", "db"], "kind": "req"}], "t": "A valid note is written to the database.", "c": "handler", "hl": [22, 22]},
    {"go": [{"path": ["db", "api", "page"], "kind": "res"}], "t": "The new id comes back to the page in the reply.", "c": "handler", "hl": [23, 23]}
   ]},
  {"id": "offline", "title": "Save while offline",
   "sum": "Without a connection the page keeps the note in localStorage and sends it later.",
   "steps": [
    {"go": [{"path": ["page", "store"], "kind": "msg"}], "t": "The request fails, so the page queues the note in localStorage."},
    {"go": [{"path": ["store", "page", "api"], "kind": "req"}], "t": "Back online, the page sends the queued note.", "c": "post", "hl": [12, 13]},
    {"go": [{"path": ["db", "mail"], "kind": "msg"}], "work": ["db"], "t": "Once stored, the server tells the mail service, which may answer much later.",
